# Custom Learning Management Systems (LMS)

Category: Business Management Solutions

Custom-built learning management platforms for enterprise training, customer education, and online academies.

Our Learning Management Systems (LMS) are built to deliver engaging learning experiences at scale. Designed for corporate training, compliance programs, and professional academies, our platforms offer custom course builders, progress tracking, quiz modules, and automatic certification. With zero seat licensing costs and white-label branding, you can scale training without scaling budgets.

Key features:
- Course Builder: Interactive rich-media curriculum editor. Rich learning experience.
- Assessment Engine: Automated quizzes, grading, and customized certifications. Instant verification.
- Analytics & Reports: Detailed dashboards tracking student engagement and pass rates. Clear compliance tracking.
- Multi-tenant Portals: Separate branded spaces for different client organizations. Seamless reseller business.

